extends RefCounted

# Flight events for Orbit Lab.
#
# Choice events: "world", "phase", "title", "text", "choices", optional "when".
#   Each choice: "label", "outcomes", optional "needs" (part required to pick it)
#   and "safe_if" (part that guarantees the FIRST outcome).
#   Each outcome: [chance, science change, text] or
#                 [chance, science change, text, "reason the mission was lost"].
#
# Check events ("check": true) always happen at their world and test gear:
#   "pass_if", "pass", "fail", optional "fail_science", "fatal".
#
# Requirements look like "has:instrument_drill", "not:landing_none",
# or several joined with "|" meaning any one of them.
#
# Phases run in this order: cruise, arrival, orbit, site, descent, surface.

